아래는 해당 문제를 해결하기 위한 Python 코드입니다:

```python
def solution(diffs, times, limit):
    n = len(diffs)
    dp = [[0 for _ in range(limit+1)] for _ in range(n)]

    for i in range(1, limit+1):
        if diffs[0] <= i:
            dp[0][i] = times[0]
        else:
            dp[0][i] = float('inf')

    for i in range(1, n):
        for j in range(1, limit+1):
            if diffs[i] <= j:
                dp[i][j] = min(dp[i-1][j], dp[i-1][j-diffs[i]] + times[i])
            else:
                dp[i][j] = min(dp[i-1][j], dp[i-1][j-diffs[i]] + times[i] + times[i-1])

    return min([dp[n-1][i] for i in range(1, limit+1)])
